        "@value": "CANCELLED—Creedence Clearwater Relived ~ Bad Moon Riders CCR Tribute Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;EVENT CANCELLED Creedence Clearwater Relived!! Saturday December 6th ArtSpring Theatre. An Amazing night of music and Epic nostalgia as Bad Moon Riders pay tribute to the legendary band, Creedence Clearwater Revival (CCR). The Electrifying Talent of Bad Moon Riders comprised of Members from BTO and Headpins, Deliver ALL the hits, ALL night long! From &quot;Proud [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
