        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Tue Nov 4, 7:30pm | A meeting of musical worlds, 88 Strings is a remarkable Canadian quartet that blends Chinese, Persian, and Western plucked string instruments into a mesmerizing soundscape. Described by one listener as “plucked string heaven,” the ensemble weaves classical, traditional, and newly commissioned works into rich, meditative concerts that feel both ancient [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
