    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join Meghan for this FREE, supportive and informative session. Pre-registration required to peacefulparentingmeghan@gmail.com For parent and caregivers of kids aged 10-18 Parenting preteens and teens isn\\'t easy! There\\'s so much going on in their brains and bodies and often parents find themselves struggling with discipline, connection and understanding why their child is behaving a certain [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
